Package: dynavlan
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: netplan.io (>= 0.106), tcpdump, lldpd, systemd
Maintainer: Jonathan Perel <pereljon@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/pereljon/dynavlan
Description: Self-configuring VLAN provisioner for headless Linux boxes
 Discovers active tagged VLANs on every trunk a box is plugged into,
 brings each up with DHCP (route-isolated by default), and auto-reverts
 on failure. No SSH, no hand-edited YAML.
